  "description": "Seo Yue, who was forced to marry the barbarian King of Northern Wei instead of the legitimate princess, is now in the position of a false princess. The King of Northern Wei's reaction to Seo Yue is somewhat strange.\n\n*\"This ugly body. The mere smell of rain makes me horny...\"\n\n\"Come to the bridal chamber quickly, my beautiful princess.\"*\n\nHow can they be having a wedding while the sun is still high in the sky?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
